  "evidence": "Observations of go-overlay-services are runtime observations: tests/tpnil/brc22 in lightwebinc/overlay-bridge runs every vector through the server's HTTP routes, under both route registration functions, in front of an engine that records the topics it is handed, and points go-sdk's facilitator at the running server. Observations of overlay-express are source observations at the pinned commit.",
  "setup": "Start the server under test with its BRC-22 POST /submit route in front of a recording engine that records the topics it is handed and answers a fixed topic-keyed admittance. The request body is one opaque byte: no chain, fixture transaction or funding is involved. Header vectors send that body with X-Topics set to the vector's input value; response vectors send X-Topics [\"tm_example_1\"].",
  "teardown": "Stop the server. The recording engine keeps no state beyond the run.",
  "runtimeQualification": {
    "id": "OVERLAY-BRC22-SUBMIT-BOUNDARY-GO",
    "plan": "infra/plans/overlay-brc22-submit-boundary-go.json",
    "journal": "journals/component-qualification/2026-11-08/overlay-brc22-submit-boundary-go/"
  },
  "vectors": [
    {
      "id": "brc22.topics.json-array",
      "classification": "standard",
      "clause": "Specification, API Endpoint and Parameters: the X-Topics header contains a JSON array of topic names (overlays/0022.md lines 36 and 90)",
      "input": {
        "header": "X-Topics",
        "value": "[\"tm_example_1\",\"tm_example_2\"]"
      },
      "expected": {
        "topics": [
          "tm_example_1",
          "tm_example_2"
        ]
      },
      "observations": [
        {
          "implementation": "go-overlay-services",
          "result": {
            "topics": [
              "tm_example_1",
              "tm_example_2"
            ]
          },
          "source": "pkg/server/internal/ports/topics_header.go#L26-L64",
          "evidence": "runtime"
        },
        {
          "implementation": "overlay-express",
          "result": {
            "topics": [
              "tm_example_1",
              "tm_example_2"
            ]
          },
          "source": "packages/overlays/overlay-express/src/OverlayExpress.ts#L463-L483",
          "evidence": "source"
        },
        {
          "implementation": "go-sdk-facilitator",
          "result": {
            "sends": "[\"tm_example_1\",\"tm_example_2\"]"
          },
          "source": "overlay/topic/facilitator.go#L42-L46",
          "evidence": "source"
        }
      ],
      "applicability": "Servers implementing BRC-22 POST /submit. A result other than the expected one deviates from BRC-22.",
      "proposedUse": [
        "ISI-5-V012",
        "ISI-2-V002",
        "ISI-2-V006"
      ],
      "evidence": [
